2026-10-17T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2320) 'The simulator is a desktop window. Without a way for an agent to see it and give it input, every simulator run needed a person at the keyboard.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2320  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-17T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2320) 'Run `scripts/xr-cua-oxrsys-register.sh` to register `xr-cua-oxrsys`; it prints the diff.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2320  1 LINE
